 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's main export products in 2024 were machinery and mechanical appliances, vehicles and parts, and plastics and articles thereof.",
  "Total exports amounted to 14.97 billion euros, with the top three products making up 33.4% of this value.",
  "Machinery and mechanical appliances led with 2.02 billion euros, followed by vehicles and parts at 1.49 billion euros, and plastics at 1.48 billion euros.",
  "Other products accounted for 31.7% of exports, showing a diverse export portfolio beyond the top categories.",
  "The data are in current euros and include a small confidential portion of 102.3 million euros, which limits detailed product-level analysis."
 ],
